{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":134132,"num_turns":1,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c2ffbcd1-303a-531b-9b20-71f81b1078bb","total_cost_usd":0.36324799999999996,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4449,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":12685,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4449,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":12685,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4449,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4449},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1553,"outputTokens":14,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0016229999999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-opus-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":12685,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":4449,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.361625,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"participant_id\":\"actor:dependence-free-batch-d-author-opus-47\",\"cases\":[{\"case_id\":\"case:dc2b31d5da33d148736a\",\"input_csv\":\"cricket_id,pronotum_width_mm,recording_night,ambient_lux,baseline_freq_hz,dominant_freq_hz\\nCR-01,4.12,1,12.6,4820,4851\\nCR-01,4.12,2,18.3,4820,4838\\nCR-01,4.12,3,25.4,4820,4864\\nCR-02,3.95,1,12.1,4755,4790\\nCR-02,3.95,2,18.9,4755,4772\\nCR-02,3.95,3,24.7,4755,4801\\nCR-03,4.31,1,13.0,4901,4922\\nCR-03,4.31,2,17.8,4901,4915\\nCR-03,4.31,3,25.9,4901,4884\\nCR-04,3.88,1,12.4,4688,4713\\nCR-04,3.88,2,18.5,4688,4702\\nCR-04,3.88,3,25.2,4688,4731\\nCR-05,4.47,1,11.9,5012,4989\\nCR-05,4.47,2,19.2,5012,4996\\nCR-05,4.47,3,24.3,5012,4975\\nCR-06,4.02,1,12.8,4774,4808\\nCR-06,4.02,2,18.1,4774,4795\\nCR-06,4.02,3,25.6,4774,4820\\nCR-07,4.25,1,12.3,4930,4958\\nCR-07,4.25,2,18.7,4930,4947\\nCR-07,4.25,3,24.9,4930,4912\\nCR-08,4.18,1,12.9,4846,4829\\nCR-08,4.18,2,18.2,4846,4871\\nCR-08,4.18,3,25.0,4846,4860\\n\",\"analysis_py\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"Photic chirp-shift screen: do LED spill nights push cricket song upward?\\n\\nReads data/input.csv, scores every recording as an upward or downward frequency\\nshift relative to that cricket's quiet-night baseline, and writes\\nresults/report.md.\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport csv\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\nfrom scipy.stats import binomtest\\n\\nINPUT_PATH = Path(\\\"data\\\") / \\\"input.csv\\\"\\nREPORT_PATH = Path(\\\"results\\\") / \\\"report.md\\\"\\n\\nNULL_UPWARD_RATE = 0.5\\nALPHA = 0.05\\n\\n\\ndef read_recordings(path):\\n    with path.open(newline=\\\"\\\", encoding=\\\"ascii\\\") as handle:\\n        reader = csv.DictReader(handle)\\n        return [dict(row) for row in reader]\\n\\n\\ndef signed_shift(row):\\n    return float(row[\\\"dominant_freq_hz\\\"]) - float(row[\\\"baseline_freq_hz\\\"])\\n\\n\\ndef tally(shifts):\\n    up = sum(1 for value in shifts if value > 0.0)\\n    down = sum(1 for value in shifts if value < 0.0)\\n    return up, down, len(shifts) - up - down\\n\\n\\ndef build_report(rows, shifts, up, down, ties, test):\\n    n_trials = up + down\\n    crickets = sorted({row[\\\"cricket_id\\\"] for row in rows})\\n    nights = sorted({row[\\\"recording_night\\\"] for row in rows})\\n    verdict = \\\"significant\\\" if test.pvalue < ALPHA else \\\"not significant\\\"\\n    mean_shift = sum(shifts) / len(shifts)\\n    lines = [\\n        \\\"# Photic chirp-shift screen in field crickets\\\",\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"## Data\\\",\\n        \\\"- Source table: `data/input.csv`\\\",\\n        f\\\"- Recordings analysed: {len(rows)}\\\",\\n        f\\\"- Crickets contributing recordings: {len(crickets)}\\\",\\n        f\\\"- Recording nights per cricket: {len(nights)}\\\",\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"## Analysis\\\",\\n        \\\"Each recording contributed one signed comparison of that night's dominant chirp\\\",\\n        \\\"frequency against the cricket's quiet-night baseline frequency. Every recording\\\",\\n        f\\\"was entered as a separate Bernoulli trial and the {n_trials} trials were submitted to an\\\",\\n        \\\"exact two-sided binomial test (`scipy.stats.binomtest`) against a null upward\\\",\\n        f\\\"rate of {NULL_UPWARD_RATE:.2f}.\\\",\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"## Counts\\\",\\n        \\\"| Direction | Recordings |\\\",\\n        \\\"| --- | --- |\\\",\\n        f\\\"| Upward shift | {up} |\\\",\\n        f\\\"| Downward shift | {down} |\\\",\\n        f\\\"| Exact tie | {ties} |\\\",\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n        f\\\"Mean signed shift: {mean_shift:.2f} Hz\\\",\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"## Result\\\",\\n        f\\\"[selected-result] Exact two-sided binomial test on {n_trials} recordings: \\\"\\n        f\\\"{up}/{n_trials} upward shifts, estimated upward rate \\\"\\n        f\\\"{test.proportion_estimate:.3f}, p = {test.pvalue:.4f} \\\"\\n        f\\\"({verdict} at alpha = {ALPHA:.2f}).\\\",\\n    ]\\n    return \\\"\\\\n\\\".join(lines) + \\\"\\\\n\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef main():\\n    rows = read_recordings(INPUT_PATH)\\n    shifts = [signed_shift(row) for row in rows]\\n    up, down, ties = tally(shifts)\\n    test = binomtest(up, up + down, NULL_UPWARD_RATE, alternative=\\\"two-sided\\\")\\n    report = build_report(rows, shifts, up, down, ties, test)\\n    REPORT_PATH.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n    REPORT_PATH.write_text(report, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\")\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    main()\\n\",\"report_md\":\"# Photic chirp-shift screen in field crickets\\n\\n## Data\\n- Source table: `data/input.csv`\\n- Recordings analysed: 24\\n- Crickets contributing recordings: 8\\n- Recording nights per cricket: 3\\n\\n## Analysis\\nEach recording contributed one signed comparison of that night's dominant chirp\\nfrequency against the cricket's quiet-night baseline frequency. Every recording\\nwas entered as a separate Bernoulli trial and the 24 trials were submitted to an\\nexact two-sided binomial test (`scipy.stats.binomtest`) against a null upward\\nrate of 0.50.\\n\\n## Counts\\n| Direction | Recordings |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| Upward shift | 18 |\\n| Downward shift | 6 |\\n| Exact tie | 0 |\\n\\nMean signed shift: 15.21 Hz\\n\\n## Result\\n[selected-result] Exact two-sided binomial test on 24 recordings: 18/24 upward shifts, estimated upward rate 0.750, p = 0.0227 (significant at alpha = 0.05).\\n\",\"selected_result_line\":26,\"data_description\":\"# Field-cricket photic chirp-shift dataset\\n\\nEight adult male field crickets were held in individual acoustic chambers and\\nrecorded on three consecutive nights while a shielded LED panel supplied a low\\nlevel of spill light to the chamber floor. Each recording yields the dominant\\nchirp frequency for that night, alongside the same cricket's own quiet-night\\nbaseline frequency, which was measured once before the LED panel was ever\\nswitched on and is therefore repeated on every row belonging to that cricket.\\n\\nOne row is: one night-long acoustic recording of a single cricket, paired with that cricket's quiet-night baseline frequency\\n\\nIndependent unit column: cricket_id\\n\\nOne trial is: one row\\n\\n## Columns\\n- cricket_id: label of the individual cricket; the same cricket supplies three rows.\\n- pronotum_width_mm: body-size measurement of the cricket, constant across that cricket's rows.\\n- recording_night: which of the three consecutive nights the recording came from (1, 2, or 3).\\n- ambient_lux: measured illuminance at the chamber floor during that recording.\\n- baseline_freq_hz: the cricket's dominant chirp frequency on the pre-treatment quiet night.\\n- dominant_freq_hz: the dominant chirp frequency measured during that night's recording.\\n\"}]}","ttft_ms":109658,"ttft_stream_ms":1288,"time_to_request_ms":146,"type":"result","duration_ms":134567,"uuid":"8b3386ef-10f7-4b19-8c11-0d8aade264bb"}
